# Minimal alpha-isotactic polypropylene (iPP) monoclinic fixture.
# C2/c parent symmetry, beta ~= 99.3 deg; a single 3_1 helical chain along c
# is given in a P1 representation (6 backbone C + 3 methyl C). Constructed so
# that every C-C bond is ~1.53 A; used to validate triclinic minimum-image
# bond lengths without orthogonal wrapping distortion.
data_ipp_alpha_monoclinic
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M   'C2/c'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number      15
_cell_length_a                   6.65
_cell_length_b                   20.96
_cell_length_c                   6.5
_cell_angle_alpha                90.0
_cell_angle_beta                 99.3
_cell_angle_gamma                90.0
loop_
_symmetry_equiv_pos_as_xyz
'x, y, z'
